# Line endings: stored exactly as committed. The repo already holds a mix (older files CRLF,
# newer ones LF); `* text=auto` or an `eol=` rule would renormalize half the tree in one commit.
# `-text` turns off EOL conversion for everyone, whatever their core.autocrlf, so a file keeps
# the endings it has. Prettier (`endOfLine: auto`) and .editorconfig (no end_of_line) follow suit.
* -text

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
